        "Sample construction. We start from all WPS establishments surveyed in at least one wave between 2017 and 2023 and aggregate establishments to the firm level using business registration numbers. We keep firms with 30 or more employees in 2019 that can be linked to employment-insurance records and to KIS-Value financial statements in every year from 2018 to 2023. This yields 1,250 firms. For years without a WPS wave, adoption status is taken from subsidy records and the follow-up questionnaire; the two sources agree for 94 percent of firm-years in which both are available.",
